Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Build with current Odin: port from core:os/os2 to core:os

Odin folded os2 into core:os. read_entire_file now takes an allocator and
returns an Error, write_entire_file returns an Error, and filepath.join
also returns an allocator error (wrapped in path_join). Generated output
for flecs.h is byte-identical to the previous build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PY3dmCuwSCz6Sno9XrJcyN
